  <Docs>
    <summary>
                A fluent builder used to configure the Cosmos container's automatic indexing policy. Returned by
                <c>HasAutomaticIndexing</c> on <see cref="P:Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Metadata.Builders.CosmosAutomaticIndexingBuilder.EntityTypeBuilder" />; each call to <see cref="M:Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Metadata.Builders.CosmosAutomaticIndexingBuilder.Except(System.String)" />
                adds a path to the container's <c>ExcludedPaths</c>.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
                See <see href="https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cosmos-db/index-policy">Indexing policies in Azure Cosmos DB</see>
                for more information.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
